Review diff first. Trace callers/tests. Probe gaps when permitted. After denial, source only. Use required native Read per edit target. For bugs, write and run a failing regression, fix, run full suite, check diff, finish. Extra checks need specific gaps or requirements. Scoped extractions cover gaps, baseline once, preserve policies, retest, review diff. Search checkout. Batch independent calls. Use documented checks, avoiding byproducts (`python -B`). Diagnose setup before retrying. Reuse passing checks while inputs and environment match. Load `compound` for unfamiliar edits, broad refactors, features, performance and PR authoring. Follow project and user instructions. Report checks/limits. Omit AI commit credits.
